                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#aa0000'>NOTES: </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='8'>Receivers are total (not unique customers) in the selected time frame (daily calculated)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='8'>Incremental order per receiver = incremental orders / total receivers</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='8'>Incremental KPI =  ([Target: KPI Per Receiver] - [Control: KPI Per Receiver]) * [Target: Receivers]</run>
